    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects (7) : Metoclopramide\n\n(1) Diarrhea\n(2) Drowsiness\n\n(3) Depression\n\n(4) Extrapyramidal effects\n\n(5) Neuroleptic malignant syndrome\n\n(6) Elevated prolactin\n\n(7) Torsades de Pointes\n\n[Image: efc8ba00f58dc99fdb117c2b8e3d4a9957db8e73d1f019c271be59df893cd9bb]\n\n[Image: eacc996bf578ebcae61a4bc405fd0e25bbba1258d32de75719f45931c6c2e571]\n\n[Image: 5d37aed02bad3fd41d1df8bda021ba9dbfc5ccb3d45358d4946ddc9c2eebc1bd]\n\n[Image: 86e709d6ac159ca5a4d63cd1df995fbc7d27ed2b3866c762bf806ec3e779df4c]\n\n[Image: 258bc6233f417328fe182027c177042b314ae210457200e20c6ae0b21477bfd7]\n\n[Image: c18747629ab68d0b1f3ce7b2aec363c7ea524f0aa6425a27667616eaabf35131]\n\n[Image: acb51ab1f67d2f65c612be4d88f190b2c1a034e8f320e5e5d810a25a0ba50ffd]\n\n1.1 - Antiemetic agents\n[Image: d89cfb4eef2c721f61a2ce6802d713338822cf7c47e11baded197a5ce0412aab]\n\n[Image: eab3c509c329c61d8d15268b17eee318489649e67aa871b5c58cd3c5ddb8cbf6]\n\n[Image: 2f4a8e742d966fd8cdf941e2165eb617f7829c49c1c60bc634ad434cd1fe0de6]\n\n[Image: 6daffe22807830195101aa85fecbb7c979f4c03c6c392c0ad90c3e09d4bceea0]",
